    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will control a ninja warrior. You can run, jump, cling to the walls with a hook. You need to get to the exit to complete the level. There will be various obstacles on your way. Collect coins to get more stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run - AD / Left, Right arrows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump - W / Up arrow / Space </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw a hook - LMB </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing, you will receive a ninja game with interesting gameplay, where you will need to move deftly, overcome obstacles and collect coins to reach new levels and earn stars. This is a game that will test your control skills and reaction.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will control a ninja warrior. You can run, jump, cling to the walls with a hook. You need to get to the exit to complete the level. There will be various obstacles on your way. Collect coins to get more stars. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run - AD / Left, Right arrows. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump - W / Up arrow / Space </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw a hook - LMB </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After purchasing, you will receive a ninja game with interesting gameplay, where you will need to move deftly, overcome obstacles and collect coins to reach new levels and earn stars. This is a game that will test your control skills and reaction.</p>",
    "short_description": "Control a skilled and brave ninja warrior. Collect coins and avoid traps. Throw a hook to climb up. Run to the exit to complete the level.",
